  "heading-notes": "Jehaipy mbyky",
  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "Jeheka ñembohape",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Jeheka ikatu oguereko mbohapeha oñemohesakãve hag̃ua. Mbohapeha ojehai mbohapeha réra ha hepykue mokõi kyta rupive oñemboja'óva. Techapyrã, `list:Blocked` omomichĩ jeheka kuatia'i oĩva ysaja hérava *Blocked*-pe. Hepykue oguerekórõ pa'ũ térã ta'anga ijojaha'ỹva, oñemoĩva'erã ñe'ẽrenda ryepýpe (techapyrã `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Mbohapeha ojepurukuaáva:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - kuatia'i umi peteĩcha ojoajúva *<title>* oje'éva rehe",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - kuatia'i umi ysaja ojoajúva *<title>* oje'éva rehe",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - kuatia'i umi tape ojoajúva *<title>* oje'éva rehe",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - kuatia'i oguerekóva ñe'ẽrysýi *<text>* reheve.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - kuatia'i oguerekóva techaukaha ojoajúva *<color>* térã *<name>",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - ñemombyky `__operator_label__:<color>` térã `__operator_label__:<name>` pegua",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - kuatia'i *<username>* ha'ehápe *rehegua* térã *oñeme'ẽva*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - ñemombyky `user:<username>` pegua",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - kuatia'i *<username>* ha'ehápe *rehegua*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - kuatia'i *<username>* ha'ehápe *oñeme'ẽva*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - kuatia'i *<username>* ha'ehápe kuatia'i apohára",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - kuatia'i peteĩcha oñeme'ẽva atyguasu *<name>*-pe rehegua",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - kuatia'i peteĩcha oñeme'ẽva aty *<name>*-pe rehegua",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - kuatia'i opátava *<n>* ára peve ko'ág̃agui. `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ ohechauka opaite kuatia'i arange paha ohasámava.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - kuatia'i ojejapova'ekue *<n>* ára térã sa'ive mboyve",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - kuatia'i oñemoambueva'ekue *<n>* ára térã sa'ive mboyve",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - *<status>* ha'e peteĩ ko'ãvagui:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - kuatia'i ñongatupyre",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - opaite kuatia'i ñongatupyre ha ñongatupyre'ỹva",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - kuatia'i oguerekóva arange paha",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - kuatia'i peteĩcha opavave reheguápe añónte",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - kuatia'i peteĩcha ñemiguápe añónte",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - *<field>* ha'e peteĩ `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` térã `__predicate_member__` apytégui. Emoĩramo `-` *<field>* renondépe, oheka ndaipóriha hepykue upe tendápe (techapyrã `has:-due` oheka kuatia'i arange paha'ỹva).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - *<sort-name>* ha'e peteĩ `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` térã `__predicate_modified__` apytégui. Ñemohenda oguejývape g̃uarã, emoĩ `-` ñemohenda réra renondépe.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - *<n>* ha'e papapy oku'éva ha iporãva omombe'úva mboy kuatia'ípa ojehechaukáta peteĩteĩ kuatiaroguépe.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Ikatu ojehai heta mbohapeha.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Mbohapeha ojoguáva oñembojoaju *OR* rupive. Oñeme'ẽta kuatia'i ojoajúva peteĩva umi tekóre.\n`__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` ome'ẽta kuatia'i oĩva oimeraẽ ysaja hérava *Blocked* térã *Available*-pe.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Mbohapeha ojoavy oñembojoaju *AND* rupive. Oñeme'ẽta kuatia'i ojoajúva opaite mbohapeha ojoavývare añónte. `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` ome'ẽ kuatia'i ysaja *Available*-pe oĩva techaukaha *red* reheve añónte.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Ára ikatu ojehai papapy oku'éva iporãva térã ivaíva ramo, térã `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` térã `__predicate_year__` rupive pe ára aty ko'ag̃aguápe g̃uarã.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Jehaipy jeheka ndohechái taí tuicha térã michĩ joavy.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "Ijypykuépe ndojehekái kuatia'i ñongatupyre.",
