  "draggable": "Ikatúva ojegueraha mbotyryrýpe",
  "restore-card-wip-limit-reached": "Ysaja __list__ ohupyty hi'WIP paha. Emyengovia kuatia'i ambue ysajápe:",
  "restore-card-no-list-with-room": "Opaite ysaja ko tablero-pegua ohupyty hi'WIP paha. Embotuichave peteĩ paha, térã emyanda térã eñongatu kuatia'i, emyengovia hag̃ua ko kuatia'i.",
  "restore-all-skipped-wip-limit": "__count__ kuatia'i ndojeyengoviái: hysaja ohupyty hi'WIP paha. Emyengovia peteĩteĩ eiporavo hag̃ua ambue ysaja.",
